WEBVTT

00:12:59.933 --> 00:13:02.489
victim, rapist --

00:13:02.513 --> 00:13:04.768
and labels are a way to organize concepts,

00:13:04.792 --> 00:13:09.174
but they can also be dehumanizing
in their connotations.

00:13:09.838 --> 00:13:11.938
Once someone's been deemed a victim,

00:13:11.962 --> 00:13:17.195
it's that much easier to file them away
as someone damaged,

00:13:17.219 --> 00:13:18.725
dishonored,

00:13:18.749 --> 00:13:20.024
less than.

00:13:20.643 --> 00:13:23.363
And likewise, once someone
has been branded a rapist,

00:13:23.387 --> 00:13:25.933
it's that much easier
to call him a monster --

00:13:26.576 --> 00:13:27.875
inhuman.

00:13:28.614 --> 00:13:31.645
But how will we understand
what it is in human societies